### Note: Some requests below require disabling API authentication/authorization.
###       Set 'Infrastructure:BypassAuthentication' to true in the AppHost's 'appsettings.Development.json'.

@Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5275

### Healthy check
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/health/

### OpenApi
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/openapi/v1.json

### Perform valuation of policy
POST {{Api_HostAddress}}/policies/00000000-0000-0000-0010-000000000001/valuations

### Get policy latest valuation
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/policies/00000000-0000-0000-0010-000000000001/valuations/lastest

### Get policy valuation history
GET {{Api_HostAddress}}/policies/00000000-0000-0000-0010-000000000001/valuations
